  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">About our brand and products:</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"> </span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">We are an award winning longevity skincare brand with products proven help you look your best for longer. Our products are developed in the UK to our Sanavive Longevity System. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Our science first and results focus means you can trust our products and confidently introduce them to others.  Priced £45-65, our formulations and results are on a par with the $200+ products, just more affordable.  </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Right now we have a limited time <strong>Spring Sale with 20% off, plus a free Peptide Eye Cream with all products and free UK shipping with every order,</strong> so it's a good time to join us.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">What makes us different: </span></strong></p><p><strong>1. A Proprietary Scientific Edge</strong><br>BFE-01™ is exclusive to MAYDI+, developed in collaboration with scientists and refined through green chemistry to deliver high bioavailability and performance.</p><p><strong>2. The Sanavive™ Longevity System</strong><br>Every product is guided by four pillars:</p><ul><li>Purposeful Provenance</li><li>Scientific Credibility</li><li>Green Chemistry</li><li>Living Well</li></ul><p>Together, they create skincare that supports long-term skin vitality, not short-term fixes.</p><p><strong>3. Proven, Considered Formulation</strong><br>Our range combines BFE-01™ with clinically recognised actives including peptides, ceramides and retinoids to support firmness, hydration and radiance.</p><p><strong>4. Luxury Without Excess</strong><br>Priced between <strong>£45–£65</strong>, MAYDI+ delivers performance comparable to high-end formulations, while remaining accessible.</p><p><strong>5. Conscious by Design</strong><br>Vegan, cruelty-free, UK-made and responsibly sourced, including FairWild-certified frankincense.</p><p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">How affiliates can earn: </span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Sign up for your unique link and start sharing on social media or where you have followers or clients. You may wish to run an Instagram live or email your list if you have one. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong>We look forward to working with you. </strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>Carol</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>MAYDI+™ Brand Director</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:20%;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"656\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:492pt;\"><tbody><tr height=\"21\" style=\"height:16pt;\"><td height=\"21\" class=\"xl68\" style=\"height:16pt;width:32.4671%;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">MAYDI+™ Product</span></td><td class=\"xl67\" style=\"border-left:none;width:13.1122%;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Standard RRP </span></div></td><td class=\"xl68\" style=\"border-left:none;width:111px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Affiliate Earns </span></div></td><td class=\"xl69\" style=\"border-left:none;width:96px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">20% Sale Price</span></div></td><td class=\"xl67\" style=\"border-left:none;width:149px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"